// Gem Shape Cut Dimension Schema — Source Audit Contract
// ROLE: SOURCE_AUDIT - this task produces an inventory, not code.

//
// Capability: gem cut, shape, diameter, depth and size metadata
// Proposed contract on record: input: GemShape, CutVariant, positive length/width/depth in millimetres; output: versioned typed GemSpec with canonical units and dimension validation; error_type: Result<T, DomainError> (illustrative Rust convention; must align with checked-out workspace)
//
// Inventory to fill from the pinned checkout (record file, symbol, line range, verdict):
    // - Use document mm and document tolerance
    // - never hard-code arbitrary tolerance as PASS threshold. Gem cut/size metadata and rigid instance transform remain coherent. No naked/invalid BRep when closed geometry is claimed
    // - OCCT validity check if shape is generated. Preview must be ephemeral
    // - Accept is atomic transaction
    // - Undo/Redo reverts exactly. Stable EntityId/GemId/FeatureId/LayerId when mapping is unambiguous
    // - otherwise explicit conflict. Source dependency and style provenance survive save/open without silent detach. No dependencies on specs/90-after and no duplicate M06 settings or M07 cutters. Proposed fixture identifiers
    // - user-independent procedural geometry only
    // - register exact files, SHA, inputs, oracle and tolerances when source/toolchain available. Manual references inherited from canonical L3
    // - if parent_l2_range only, do not present as command-level proof. Reinspect relevant PDF pages before asserting behavior. Inspect owning service and callers
    // - resolve BE/FEBE split and document rollback strategy. Record exact command surface in Matrix 8 Book 2 without assuming original command names exist in OpenMatrix9. If G00 or E09 is missing, only produce contract/audit and BLOCKED evidence, NOT feature completion
    // - --- bước thuật toán domain đã trích (phải đo lại hằng số trước khi dùng) ---
    // - D1. Đọc mô tả đá: lấy dữ liệu đối tượng dưới khoá MATRIXICGEM, dựng sáu điểm min/max, biến đổi bằng xform instance, suy độ lớn X/Y/Z và làm tròn.
    // - D2. Đọc profile nếu có: parse chuỗi điểm, biến đổi từng điểm, cần ít nhất 7 điểm cho các độ dài góc/đáy.
    // - D3. Suy tên: cắt tên instance theo gạch dưới, chuẩn hoá hai trường hợp đặc biệt Custom và Baguette.
//
// Decision skeleton to complete with real evidence:
//   reuse_decision: REUSE | ADAPT | ADD | BLOCKED_SOURCE
//   evidence: <path>:<line-range> at pinned SHA
//   license: <reviewed scope from M00>
//
// Do not claim "implemented", "works" or a PASS from this file.
